  "system": {
    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>You can summon a nature spirit that assumes an animal form to aid you. As a Magic action, you can expend a spell slot or a use of Wild Shape to cast the Find Familiar spell without Material components.</p><p>When you cast the spell in this way, the familiar is Fey and disappears when you finish a Long Rest.</p><section id=\"secret-4iYtjsPCmpeQTKY5\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature includes a Summon activity which can be used to summon your wild companion. You can choose whether to expend a use of wild shape or a spell slot when activating it.</p><p>The summon does not automatically disappear when you finish a Long Rest.</p></section>",
